        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions LKE150SS4, 1-1/2 Inch Diameter Lake Door Pull with Stainless Steel Mounts</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMade with your choice of <a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-Wood-cmbw.pdf?v=1704262249\">wood grip</a>, this Lake Collection Pull is great for use in both residential and commercial settings. The wrap around brackets can be finished in either satin stainless steel or polished stainless steel. The Lake 1-1/2 Inch Wooden Door Pull with Stainless Steel Wrap Around Mounts can be thru-bolt mounted, surface mounted, or back-to-back mounted. Choose from 18 inch, 24 inch, or 36 inch lengths.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nDon't see the right Wood Finish Color?  Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> and we can make it for you!\r\n<br>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/lake-1-inch-wooden-door-pull-with-stainless-steel-wrap-around-mounts-first-impressions-lke100ss4\"><b>1 Inch Wood Door Pull with Stainless Steel Mounts</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions LKE150SS4 Lake Wood Door Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Solid Wood</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Solid Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-Wood-cmbw.pdf?v=1704262249\"><b>First Impressions Wood Color Guide (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-LKE04-specifications.pdf?v=1704262338\"><b>First Impressions LKE150SS4 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>LKE150018SS4:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3.28\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1.66\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LKE150024SS4:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3.28\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1.66\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LKE150036SS4:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3.28\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1.66\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This wood door handle is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Different Wood Types</b> and <b>Other Lengths</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Cancelable or Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
