                "description": "Made with your choice of wood grip, this Lake Collection Pull is great for use in both residential and commercial settings. The wrap around brackets can be finished in either satin stainless steel or polished stainless steel. The Lake 1-1/2 Inch Wooden Door Pull with Stainless Steel Wrap Around Mounts can be thru-bolt mounted, surface mounted, or back-to-back mounted. Choose from 18 inch, 24 inch, or 36 inch lengths.",
